+ * sun's highlight and Fresnel for free, and on top of that:
+ *  - colour by depth: the bottom showing through at the edge, going to the
+ *    lake's own deep colour further in;
+ *  - ripples from a tiling normal map in two scrolling layers, traded for
+ *    roughness where a pixel can no longer resolve them, and stirred by the
+ *    weather;
+ *  - the reflection of the surrounding slopes rather than of sky, below the
+ *    skyline the planner surveyed — a lake under a mountain wall is dark in
+ *    it, one on a plain is all sky;
+ *  - reed beds at the margins of the reedy lakes, grass through a flooded
+ *    meadow, crust and brine on a salt lake;
+ *  - ice and snow in winter, and on the high tarns whenever the season's
+ *    snow line is below them.
